        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1716_6293.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser fründtlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gruoß</unclear>, sampt was wir liebs und guots -
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoegend</unclear> zuvor fromm, fürsichtig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersam</unclear> wyß, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inbesonders</unclear>
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> fründt, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unndt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieb</unclear> <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnossenn</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unsere</unclear> jüngst <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName> gewesne ehrenngesandte habendt
<lb n="5"/>unnß berichtet, waß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwere</unclear> daselbst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehapte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrennpottschafft</unclear>,
<lb n="6"/>inn üwerem namen, über unnser vorgeendts an üch abgangnes
<lb n="7"/>vermanung schryben, das ir üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">betroewenden</unclear> gefhar
<lb n="8"/>halber gerüst unndt bereÿt halten woellind, damit so es die notturfft
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erforderte</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> unnß vermög der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pündten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tröstliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hilff</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leyten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuospringen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moechtindt</unclear>, sich erclärt, das ir namlich
<lb n="11"/>alles das, was <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">luth</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermög</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pündten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schuldig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züerstatten</unclear>, ja lyb, guot
<lb n="12"/>unndt bluot zuo unnß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesetzen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesinnet</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">were</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwere</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thättliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hilff</unclear> (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> doch nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">groß</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unndt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">starck</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unndt</unclear> nit über 150. oder uffs hoechst 200. mann
<lb n="15"/>sin wurde) üweren burgeren wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handtierung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unndt</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewerben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wölche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sÿ</unclear> inn Herkoÿsinne <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-437" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Savöÿ</placeName>, Pündtmont
<lb n="17"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-311" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Meÿlandt</placeName> unndt an anderen derglychen enden, unndt orten fürendt,
<lb n="18"/>zuo mercklichem schaden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unndt</unclear> nachteil <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">reichen</unclear>, in dem man von
<lb n="19"/>diser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hilff</unclear> schickung wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ursach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nemen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">möchte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ire</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waren</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nider</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeleggen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeconfiscieren</unclear>,
<lb n="21"/>wir üch dessen so immer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müglich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">güetiglich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">überheben</unclear>, mit dem
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbieten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> statt der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thättlichen</unclear> hilff monatlich so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lanng</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gschäfft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">möchte</unclear>, in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geheimbd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwüssen</unclear> pfenning
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zegeben</unclear>, unndt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nechsterer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeertzen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dar</unclear> unnser intention
<lb n="25"/>üch zuo üwerer nachrichtung zverstendigen woeltindt.
<lb n="26"/>Wann wir nun söllichs aungchoert unndt verstanden habendt
<lb n="27"/>wir ab üwerem trüwhertzigen anerbieten ein sonderen
<lb n="28"/>trost unndt vernuegen empfanngen, deßwegen dan auch nit
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underlaßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dessen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zum</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">höchsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlichisten</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zebedancken</unclear>, unndt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daby</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubergewißen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">da</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> auch etwas
<lb n="31"/>unglägenheÿt
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1716_6294.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungelaegenheit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zustaehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soelte</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daruor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">doch</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gott</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnaedig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewaren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woelle</unclear>, das wir mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maeßiger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guet</unclear>-
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hertzigkeit</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">setzen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schuldige</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pflicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hilff</unclear> Gottes <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">trüwlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leisten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werdent</unclear>. Was nun
<lb n="36"/>üwer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anmuoten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">belangt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demnach</unclear> wir üch
<lb n="37"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vertrüwten</unclear> lieben <orgName resp="#ner">Eydtgnossen</orgName>, so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüt</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müglich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schaden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungelaegenheit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesün</unclear> gantz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willig</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßhaben</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißmalens</unclear> in dem Namen
<lb n="40"/>Gottes (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">doch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesamen</unclear> habenden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pündten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jetz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear>
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">künfftigklich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schaden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abbruch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschmaellerung</unclear>)
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> zuo üwerem begeren geneigt, undt hiemit diser züt
<lb n="43"/>der thaetlichen hilff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlassen</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beding</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wan</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hernach</unclear>
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hilff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">manen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> uns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">statt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derselben</unclear>,
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">monatlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lang</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschaefft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moechte</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sechßhundert</unclear>
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">silbercroneen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschiessen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lassen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woliches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear>
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernuegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dancknemmen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehmeiner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wulffahr</unclear>,
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kriegsnoeten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellend</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gott</unclear>
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allmechtigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pietende</unclear>, das er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">boese</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anschleg</unclear>
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oraticken</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnaedigklich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zerstören</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allersüts</unclear>
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">under</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sünem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schirm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewaren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woelle</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sindt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiejn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">forst</unclear>
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">degesinnet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moechtendt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andtwordt</unclear>
<lb n="53"/>by disem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">botten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewertig</unclear>.
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wÿe</unclear> wir von unnserem geliebten Mitrhat dem <persName resp="#ner">herren von
<lb n="55"/>Diessbach</persName> verstanden, wie die sachen sich an denen graentzen,
<lb n="56"/>undt by <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-169" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Genff</placeName> ansehen lassend, haben wir nit umbgan
<lb n="57"/>üch by diser gelaegenheit durch bÿligende copÿ desselben
<lb n="58"/>bericht zemachen. Gott wende es alles zum bestenn.
<lb n="59"/>Datum <origDate when="1611-03-05" resp="#ner">5. Martÿ. 1611</origDate>.
<lb n="60"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-514" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Schuldtheüß undt Rhat
<lb n="61"/>der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Statt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bernn</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1716_6295.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1716_6296.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="62"/>Den frommen, fürsichtigen,
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersammen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿsen</unclear>, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear>
<lb n="64"/>und Rhat der Statt St. Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> insonders <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear>
<lb n="66"/>fründen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> getrüwen
<lb n="67"/>lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eÿdtgnoßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>.
</p>
